    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38329" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαρτ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
		(cf. sq.) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ready-equipped,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαρτέες εἰσὶν ἑταῖροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.151
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				14.332
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆες, ἐδωδή,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.235
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.299
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαρτάω</span>) <i>depending,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαρτέες ἐκ νεφελάων . . πηγυλίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					270.1
				</span></i>
			 (s. v. l.).</div>
